submittedParameters.prompt:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset type: usable production game industry world sprites, 9 complete separate compounds in a precise 3x3 equal grid.
True transparent alpha. Target2048 square. Each complete compound entirely inside 80% of its cell width and height, wide transparent gutters, no touching neighbors, all 9 same world-art scale.
2:1 orthographic isometric camera from southeast, upper-left daylight. First two references establish fine jade/teal, warm ivory, subtle warm gold, rounded Taoist chibi high-definition handpainting. Third reference is world camera and material fidelity. Combine refined Chinese roofs with recognizable whimsical toyland industrial equipment; do not erase their functional identity. Thin flat stone yard rhombuses, no thick islands. NO text, numbers, people, UI frames, badges, checkerboard or watermark.
Left-to-right/top-to-bottom:
1 candy factory: jade-roof cream workshop with copper candy kettle, trays of pastel sweets and striped sugar pipes; tasteful candy ornament not giant gingerbread house;
2 battery farm: a cultivated orderly group of tall cylindrical cream/jade battery cells with copper terminals, low collecting conduits and a tiny jade-roof control shed;
3 cola wells: three dark brown cola springs in round stone basins, copper well pumps and cream bottling barrels, jade service canopy;
4 toy shop: welcoming small ivory two-storey jade-roof store, open window with wooden toy train, spinning top, rabbit doll, no words on shopfront;
5 toy factory: larger jade-roof manufacturing hall, exposed chunky gold toy press, conveyor with little wooden train toys and packaged toy boxes, distinct from candy factory;
6 plastic fountain facility: three elegant stylized copper fountain nozzles pouring translucent pale mint/lilac liquid plastic into low round collecting basins, small jade-roof workshop;
7 fizzy drink factory: tall cream/jade cylindrical carbonation vessels, bottling conveyor with small pale green bottles, copper cooling pipes and teal-roof bottling hall;
8 bubble generator: ivory round chamber with jade dome, copper pipe arch and small ring nozzle emitting several transparent pastel bubbles just above it; keep all bubbles inside cell;
9 toffee quarry: shallow terraced caramel-gold toffee excavation with soft cuboid candy strata, small copper digging drill and jade-roof loading hut, tiny caramel blocks in carts.
Distinct silhouettes, all equipment readable at small world size. Clean edges, detailed warm brush shading, no photorealism, no plastic CGI gloss, no pixel art.

